---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import inbox from '../assets/screenshots/quest-inbox.png';
---

<section class="section" id="quest-inbox" aria-labelledby="inbox-title">
  <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
    <div><h2 id="inbox-title">Quest Inbox</h2></div>
    <p>See which quest needs a decision and what evidence is ready to review. Your local work survives agent exit and restart.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="inbox-feature">
    <figure class="evidence-card">
      <Image
        src={inbox}
        alt="Quest Inbox parchment with a character picker review and a web migration decision"
        format="png"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <figcaption>Production render with sample quests.</figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="inbox-workflow">
      <p>
        <strong>Triage by quest.</strong> Press <kbd>b</kbd>, then <kbd>i</kbd>.
        Mark a summons seen or defer it for 15 minutes. Its deadline survives a restart.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Review the exact revision.</strong> Press <kbd>v</kbd> on an owned quest.
        Read the pinned Git changes and any Pi or Codex report. Import the operator’s
        passing check receipt for that commit, then explicitly settle the review.
      </p>
      <p>
        Open the Inbox at startup with <code>inbox_on_start = true</code>.
        Use <kbd>a</kbd> to create or open a local store. From the Board, press <kbd>w</kbd> for the War Table.
      </p>
      <a class="button button-secondary" href="https://github.com/opsydyn/herdr-questmancer/blob/main/docs/manual-test/quest-inbox.md">
        Read the Inbox walkthrough <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #quest-inbox { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }

  #inbox-title { font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem); line-height: 1.2; }

  .inbox-feature {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.55fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: start;
    gap: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .inbox-feature .evidence-card { grid-column: auto; }

  .inbox-feature img { width: 100%; height: auto; }

  .inbox-workflow p { color: var(--muted); }

  .inbox-workflow strong, kbd { color: var(--paper); }

  .inbox-workflow code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .inbox-feature { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
